  "name": "Question 3",
  "problem": "Which of the following probabilities could be approximated using the normal approximation of the binomial distribution?\n\nI. The probability of a student getting $27$ correct answers on a true/false quiz with $50$ questions if the student answers all questions randomly.\n\nII. The probability of finding more than $15$ redheads in a randomly selected sample of $30$ people, given that the probability that a randomly selected person has red hair is $0.12.$\n\nIII. The probability of getting $3$ defective smartphones in a box containing $20$ smartphones if the probability that an individual smartphone is defective is $0.18.$",
